   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2023-09-29",
   "text": "American Genetic Privacy Act of 2023\n This bill prohibits a commercial DNA testing service from disclosing an individual's genetic information to China or any entity under the influence, control, or ownership of China.\n The Federal Trade Commission is authorized to enforce this bill."
  }
